ckly take down multiple targets]\nThis is a simulation game designed for competitions and shooting practice."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "24817750137845973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_24817750141179306_6087807556077998662_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t2dhghTX5NYQ7kNvwFGNzad&_nc_oc=AdrKDSPR8XRU0wrVzE6VuWE_2boTeXhPRgNGQK0_-Tu39ueXeMmoQSgjhMdo_QoJAaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLsQtUj11o1vUN_ffGXRpdE35Bz_ZjADz3tccKjO1cClg&oe=6AAEA4F0"}, {"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8.png", "id": "24721984530743573", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_24721984550743571_6773484904466556326_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cSMdmPWBKFsQ7kNvwFz9AVo&_nc_oc=AdpOT1K1pvcWYxpHVhMZNeLOHf47q7daXs4oK5VtwzoQjth7xfO3UUBVv10JXoUBCpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIAnAfidDe70V-q4dWL4PqAqQT69LZ52tsp23n2MCOmwA&oe=6AAEB018"}, {"file_name": "\u30ed\u30b4\u30fb\u4efb\u610f.png", "id": "4038592343072455", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310840_4038592346405788_5288807658707250735_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xiakLYsw-bQQ7kNvwHoUFyL&_nc_oc=AdovqLegTDsiCu243I54RW7GORHvPbPeF18fwZIQ9ut6zVtlmeuNYUxcqQ36KHQd6dI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZBg6BLjjTvkUNKdM0ghhpkn40jFjfaXpPn67y6kDGzw&oe=6AAEA2FE"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3.png", "id": "1877521716130572", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618064_1877521719463905_4195426819440372670_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bHR1nX963TkQ7kNvwHKLbqk&_nc_oc=AdoERzaSpVTvJkmlJpw4SKoEhfQQn0pV